From: Mateus Lima Alves <mateuslima.ti@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: ls1021a-iot: the SAI2 FIFO is big-endian

Without it the SGTL5000 gets silence and capture returns zeros.

---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/ls1021a-iot.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/ls1021a-iot.dts
@@ -371,6 +371,8 @@
 &sai2 {
 	/* the LS1021A SAI registers are big-endian, like the DCU and eDMA */
 	big-endian;
+	/* and so is its FIFO data */
+	fsl,big-endian-fifo;
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
